<!--
    P0 prototype/symbol replay, P5 type seeding and P9 naming/declarations.
    An authored MSABI function compares its incoming EDX parameter with 7 and 11,
    then reuses EDX for the values 42 and 41 passed to sink. A usepoint-scoped
    type/name assertion on the later definition must not replace the input.
    Before the fix the assertion is accepted, but the comparisons read an
    uninitialized v1 while the signature still declares property. No option is
    needed for this correctness fix. The second rebuild checks persistence.
-->
<bytechunk space="ram" offset="0x100000" readonly="true">
4883ec2883fa07740c83fa0b7516ba29000000eb05ba2a000000e80c000000
4883c428c331c04883c428c389d0c3
